id: CTB-SRC0012-H
source: SRC-0012
section: §H
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000091
text: Acceptance principle: All currently implemented and supported monetary rules are seeded, discoverable and configurable within their intended scope, subject to authorized approval and invariant-preserving constraints. Future supported rules can be added through the same governed extension mechanism. No hardcoded business default may silently override the effective approved configuration.
